Create, list, update, disable, enable, delete, and reset passwords for staff accounts through orbit-staff (HMAC). Recreate is disabled because Keycloak retains federated profiles. Reserved directory accounts are rejected: admin, keycloak-bind, stalwart-bind, verdaccio-bind, verdaccio-ci.

Usage:
  orbit staff [command]

Available Commands:
  create         Create a staff member (LLDAP + retained mailbox)
  delete         Delete a staff member
  disable        Disable a staff member
  enable         Enable a staff member
  get            Get a staff member
  list           List staff members
  recreate       Deprecated: use the safe Keycloak identity reset procedure
  reset-password Rotate the LLDAP password used for staff SSO and mailbox sign-in
  update         Update display name, profile names, forward, or groups

Flags:
  -h, --help                 help for staff
      --owner-store string   path to owner.json vault
      --server string        staff server URL (or ORBIT_STAFF_URL)

Global Flags:
      --config string   Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

Use "orbit staff [command] --help" for more information about a command.
